Open Vanilla 0027: Sign in with Google (crates/wenilla-realm/src/auth/google.rs), a second external provider
next to Discord through the existing provider seam: OpenID Connect code flow, scopes openid and profile only
(the realm learns a stable Google id and a display name, never the e-mail address). On when GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
and GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET are set (hetzner/google_signin.sh). The sign-in page shows Google's own white button
with the G, right under Discord; the steps line and the guest note no longer name Discord only. Guests link Google the same way
they link Discord (oauth::callback is provider-generic).

